    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I don&#39;t have a solution because I don&#39;t exactly understand the problem, but please note that the solutions given here would not work from the simple reason that every input must have a unique ID.  This is not just a good practice, it&#39;s something that MUST be followed, otherwise your app will not work properly.  The first argument to `sliderInput()` is an ID, and that has to be different for every single input</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
